	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 『機動戦士ガンダムSEED』HDリマスター化に合わせ、ガンプラHGシリーズを完全リニューアル。 ■アクションベース２（別売）に連結可能なアタッチメントパーツが新規に付属。 ■所属軍識別マークや機体番号など、貼るだけでドレスアップできるデザインマーキングシールを新規追加。 ■パッケージデザインを一新。 ■よりアニメに忠実な色を再現。"
		],
		"en": [
			"• The GunplaHG series has been completely renewed in line with the HD remastering of Mobile Suit GundamSEED. ■New attachment parts that can be connected to Action Base 2 (sold separately) are included. ■Added a new MarkingSeal design that allows you to dress up your aircraft just by pasting on it, such as your army identification mark or aircraft number. ■New package design. ■Reproduce colors more faithful to the anime."
		]
